---
// The opening picture of the research report.
//
// It shows the way the work was done and nothing of how it ended. From the
// left, a handful of tries runs into a bar that was set before the run. Behind
// the bar stands a column of pages that were held back to measure on. One line
// goes on, fans out into the next tries, and meets the next bar. The picture is
// open at its right edge.
//
// It is inline so that the style sheet paints it. Its classes take the tokens of
// the site, so one drawing serves both themes. It holds no text and no number.
const label = 'Tries branch through successive rounds: each meets a bar that was set beforehand, and what passes feeds the next tries.';
